	"StockRole": "Light Workhorse",
	"YangsThoughts": "Weighing in at twenty five tons, the Mist Lynx is a lightweight workhorse OmniMech. The Mist Lynx is built on a lightweight Endo Steel chassis and a XL engine to save weight. The Mist Lynx also has six Jump Jets and a fixed Active Probe. For protection, the Mist Lynx has three and a half tons of Ferro-Fibrous armor. In its primary configuration the Mist Lynx is armed to engage an enemy at any range. For long range combat, the Mist Lynx carries a single LRM-10 launcher, which is backed up by a Streak SRM-4 launcher for close combat. Finally, the Mist Lynx carries two Machine Guns.",
